<title>UK: London gold fixes just easier, remains quiet.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes just easier, remains quiet.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $338.45 vs $338.70 AM. New York lost early firmer tone on light selling. Dollar dipped but held after under-forecast durable goods data. Support around $337.00.</p>
<p>SILVER - Cent firmer at $4.78/$4.80. Quiet.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Barely firmer at $412.00/$417.00. Unmoved by Amplats estimate of lower Russian 1997 exports.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Unchanged at $195.00/$200.00</p>
</text>
